<title>POLAND: POLISH INSURER POLISA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 8.</title>
<headline>POLISH INSURER POLISA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 142,815 shares of Polish insurer TUR Polisa SA at eight zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Polisa starts trade on the bourse's main market on November 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
